    "body": "Implementation update: integrated a five-charge reusable canteen using the existing LEX_WATER_BOTTLE interaction shell. One confirmed native consumption spends one persisted charge, restores the exact hot-reloaded [CanteenDeveloper] StaminaCorePerDrink amount, restores the reusable shell, and reports N/5 or empty. Crafting it from one Empty Bottle initializes full; multiplicity is now one item rather than five disposables. I removed only its old fixed +25 effect after decompiled ordering proved it would visibly restore even an empty canteen before correction; the authored animation/consumption remains. Combined release build and live LEXEDITOR recipe load pass. Keeping actionable until the corrected deferred install lands.",
